# What NOT to upload as site content (Cloudflare Workers static assets).
#
# The deploy runs `npx wrangler deploy`, which installs wrangler into
# node_modules/ inside this repo BEFORE uploading — so without this file the
# upload includes wrangler's own 129 MiB workerd binary and fails the 25 MiB
# per-asset limit. node_modules is the line that matters; the rest just keeps
# the deploy to actual site files.
node_modules
.git
.gitignore
.assetsignore
wrangler.jsonc
package.json
bun.lock
bun.lockb
package-lock.json

# Dev-only, not part of the served site
tools
CLAUDE.md
HANDOVER.md
README.md
